meta {
  name: Add Cart Item
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/onlineorderdetail
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  onlineOrderId: 
  ~productId: 
  ~quantity: 
  ~shouldCalculateTax: 
  ~forceSeparate: 
  ~relationshipGroupID: 
  ~sourceProgrammingKey: 
}

body:json {
  [
    {
      "Name": "",
      "Value": ""
    }
  ]
}

docs {
  `POST /api/v2/onlineorderdetail`

  Add a product to an online order: send productId (and optionally quantity) in the query string with an optional array of misc fields as the body, or leave productId out and send the with-overrides payload, which carries ProductID, Quantity and Misc in the body (its overridden values are not currently applied on this route).

  Required scope: `api/Write`

  Fill in the required query parameters on the **Params** tab before sending.

  Optional query parameters are disabled; enable the ones you need on the **Params** tab.
}
